      },
      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Nemotron Prompt Analytics\n\nThis dashboard monitors how LLM prompts are constructed and whether they fit within the Nemotron context window.\n\n**Key Metrics:**\n- **Token Count Distribution**: How many tokens per prompt. Higher counts increase latency and cost.\n- **Truncation Rate**: Percentage of prompts requiring truncation to fit the context window.\n- **Per-Section Truncation**: Which prompt sections (detections, scene context, history) are most frequently cut.\n- **Context Utilization**: How much of the context window is used. >90% means truncation is likely.\n\n**Targets:** Context utilization < 85% (comfortable headroom), Truncation rate < 5% (minimal data loss)"
      },
      "title": "Documentation",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Average prompt token count",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "#76B900",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "mappings": [],
